The files in this directory are samples of Snowball's test vocabularies
(https://github.com/snowballstem/snowball-data), each word with the stem
Snowball's own stemmer gives it, kept to test that the interpreter gives
the same. Each file's header says which words of the vocabulary it keeps:
every k-th from the first, so the sample is the same each time it is
made.

Where Snowball's vocabulary is its own, under its BSD license, the sample
keeps about 1000 words, and Snowball's notice is:

